  ▌ keyway doctor [options]

  Check the ssh config, ssh itself and this terminal. Changes nothing, and exits
  2 when a check fails.

  Options:
       --json  Output as JSON

  Global Options: See `keyway --help`

  Examples:
  Check the setup
    keyway doctor

  List what is not fine, in a script
    keyway doctor --json | jq -r '.checks[] | select(.status != "ok") | .detail'

  Connect only when the setup is sound
    keyway doctor && keyway
